"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Active 3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> stage</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of labour</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12184]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Maintain levels </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>after</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> labour</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12185]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3 days after SVD.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12186]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5 days after C/S.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12187]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tranexa</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>mic</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> acid till </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>lochia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> is minimal (21 \u2013 58days carrier).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12188]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Thromboprophylaxis avoided if level &lt; 06, use </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>UfH</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> If it is required.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12189]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>PPH prophylaxis: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12190]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tranexamic</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> acid 1g three times a day</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> for 7 \u2013 14 days (all Pts).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12191]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Neonat</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>al Management:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12192]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cord blood sampling \u2013 results interpreted against age \u2013 adjusted ranges.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12193]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Repeat testing 3 \u2013 6m</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> of age in mild cases.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12194]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Oral vitamin K.</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>affected</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12195]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Cranial USG </span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##2F5496; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>neonates.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12196]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>MRI Skull \u2013 if S/S of ICH or ICH on USG.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12197]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Short term P</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><sup>0</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> prophylaxis \u2013 severe/ Moderate cases with traumatic delivery, Pre \u2013 Term</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> birth</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> and @   ed risk of bleeding.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12198]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Female Baby =&gt; No testing required.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12199]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Target Levels:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12200]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Antenatal</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> = &gt; 0.5</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12201]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Treatment given &gt; 1.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12202]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>I/P &gt;1.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12203]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Procedures = &gt; 0.5.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12204]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>PP = &gt; 0.5.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12205]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>VTE prophylaxis &gt; 0.6.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12206]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>I/M injections &gt; 0.5/</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12207]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Regional </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Anaesthesia </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>&gt; 0.5</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12208]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Fetal Effects of Hemophilia:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12209]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Genetic Transmission.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12210]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>IC</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>H</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12211]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ECH.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[12212]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Matern</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>al Effects</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> of Hemophilia</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-r